## 🎯 Project Objective

The main objective of Study Buddy is to make college learning easier, smarter, and more interactive by combining document understanding, Retrieval-Augmented Generation, and Large Language Models.

It aims to reduce the time students spend searching through lengthy notes and provide a personalized AI-powered learning experience.

